Steps to run the project:
1- Run the back-end logic first in your IDE, then run this interface while the back-end is running.

2-Steps to run the project throw console:
*Navigate to the project file.
*Enter "npm i" command.
*Enter "npm run dev" command.

3- In case you want to add a new product in the web application, do not leave any field empty!.

4- When uploading pictures, only JPG/JPEG format is acceptable.



